{"id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-theory-set.md","title":"Theory Set","display":"df-theory-set — Theory Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-theory-set","aliases":["92-df-theory-set"],"display":"df-theory-set — Theory Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-theorem]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-theory-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-theory-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-set — Theory Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60c7ba64b8865701\" href=\"?note=60c7ba64b8865701\" title=\"92-df-theorem\">92-df-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-theory-set-—-Theory-Set-$\\mathrm{Th}$\">df-theory-set — Theory Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Thm}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\)</span> (theorem set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60c7ba64b8865701\" href=\"?note=60c7ba64b8865701\" title=\"92-df-theorem\">92-df-theorem</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (definition-target notation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Th}(G)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Thm}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Th}(G)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Thm}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>的理论（可证句子集）</li>\n<li>理论是系统的&quot;定理内容&quot;</li>\n<li>若形式系统的公理与规则实例可有效判定（例如<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a>中的初等系统），则可枚举其有限证明，故定理码集是c.e.；只知道公理可判定而不知道规则有效性并不足够</li>\n<li>句法不完备不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\neq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\neq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>，而是存在句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\neg\\varphi\\notin\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(\\varphi,\\neg\\varphi\\notin\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span></li>\n<li>只有当标准算术结构满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的全部公理且规则可靠时，才有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-theory-set-—-Theory-Set-$\\mathrm{Th}$","text":"df-theory-set — Theory Set $\\mathrm{Th}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"60c7ba64b8865701","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-2","targe